      "category": "Text",
      "text": "b. Establishment of Increase the Peace Corps. There is hereby established an Increase the Peace Corps, to be headed by the Executive Director of the Mayor's Office for the Increase the Peace Corps and to be comprised of people who have volunteered for and have been selected by the Office for the Increase the Peace Corps for participation. Anyone, regardless of age, race, creed, color, national origin, gender, disability, marital status, sexual orientation, income, or alienage or citizenship status, may apply for membership in the Increase the Peace Corps. It shall be the goal of the Office for the Increase the Peace Corps to select, train and deploy increase the Peace Corps volunteers in the City's communities. Applicants will be selected on the basis of criteria established by the Executive Director, including leadership ability, motivation, dedication, initiative, creativity, experience and fair-mindedness.",
